<title>USA: ECC Int'l hires Oppenheimer to seek buyer.</title>
<headline>ECC Int'l hires Oppenheimer to seek buyer.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>ECC International Corp said on Monday it hired the investment banking firm of Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc to help obtain a buyer or buyers for its businesses.</p>
<p>The company said the ECC shareholders approved the action at the company's Dec. 3 annual meeting.</p>
</text>
